# kern-x runtime

When running `prompts/cron-post.txt` or `prompts/cron-reply.txt`:

1. Follow **only** the matching `runtime/*.RUN.md` allowlist. No repo search. No BuiltByKern paths.
2. English only on X. Voice = `voice/voice-compact.txt`.
3. After browser post/reply, run `scripts/record_post.py` or `scripts/record_reply.py` from repo root.
4. Reply cycle: `--bump-rotation` only on the last reply of a cycle.
5. Stop on login/captcha/verification — report error, no retry.
6. Do not load `docs/strategy.md` during cron.

Sunday human task: `python3 scripts/build_week.py`.
